Hi Gabriella,

1. correct.
2. Yes, the bug was that the developing version was not being installed.

- You don't have to use gl.install.vanilla.dartR every time you install a new version of dartR. You have to do this only once.
- The parameter "dependencies= TRUE" does not install all the packages used in dartR.
- The most reliable way to install the developing version od dartR regardless of the version of what dartR version you have is:

> devtools::install_github("green-striped-gecko/dartR@dev",build_vignettes = TRUE)

Cheers,
Luis

